 "WhatsNew": {
  "caption": "A timeline: the dot, version and date, the update button; Added / Changed lines; \"you are here\".",
  "html": "<div class=\"st-ex\"><div class=\"k st-s free\"><div class=\"dlg dgx-setwin\" style=\"width:520px;padding:16px 24px\"><div class=\"dgx-tl\"><div class=\"dgx-rn\"><span class=\"dgx-dot\"></span><div class=\"dgx-rh\"><span class=\"dgx-v\">3.31.0</span><span class=\"dgx-dt2\">today · Nov 11</span><span class=\"btn\">Update to 3.31.0</span></div><div class=\"dgx-it\"><span>Added</span><span>Every piece can be shown, shown only when it has something to say, or hidden. Hiding it stops the work behind it. Settings opens on that list.</span></div><div class=\"dgx-it\"><span></span><span>Any file that is not a picture opens from Files into Preview. Any text file up to 1 MB can be edited, on this computer or another.</span></div><div class=\"dgx-it\"><span>Changed</span><span>The pull request panel opens on what stops it (the failing step and its last log lines, or the review comment), with one action.</span></div></div><div class=\"dgx-rn\" style=\"padding-bottom:8px\"><span class=\"dgx-dot dgx-here\"></span><div class=\"dgx-rh\"><span class=\"dgx-v\">3.30.0</span><span class=\"dgx-you\">you are here</span></div></div><div class=\"dgx-rn\" style=\"padding-bottom:0\"><span class=\"dgx-dot dgx-small\"></span><div class=\"dgx-fold\">Older<span class=\"dgx-dt2\">3.29.0 to 3.27.0</span><svg class=\"i i12\"><use href=\"#lu-chevron-right\"/></svg></div></div></div><span class=\"dgx-you\">you are here</span></div></div></div>"
